# Social colours

Use these colours for social media graphics and other promotional tiles, such as a post about a new civica release or a household's first automation. They are not for the Home Assistant interface: for dashboards, use [Web-app colours](colour-web-app.html). Social colours do not change with the household's theme colour.

The social palette has the same colours as the [web-app palette](colour-web-app.html#web-app-palette) without the browns and the 2 dark mode blues. Its bright accents help a post stand out in a busy feed.

