## Use colour to reflect tone

Choose colours for what the post needs to do. A power cut notice needs to feel serious and practical. A tip about a first automation can be bolder, so that it stands out.

A tonal colour uses the tints and shades of one colour family. A companion colour is one of the 9 checked pairs of contrasting colours listed under [Companion colour set](#companion-colour-set).

